## Starting a session

**Claude Code (primary):** open this repo — `CLAUDE.md` + `CONTEXT.md` load on startup and the
`.claude/` agents + commands are available. Tell Claude the task; it loads the matching `skills/*.md`
and delegates to `ux-designer` / `ui-designer`.

**Claude.ai chat (optional reference):** paste this to load the context as reference (the agents
don't execute in chat — drive the work manually from the skills):

```
Load my project context from:
https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{GITHUB_OWNER}}/{{STUDIO_REPO}}/main/CONTEXT.md

