## Updating the context

- **Screen patterns / recipes change** → update `skills/screens.md`.
- **{{SYSTEM_NAME}} republished by the DS context** → refresh the read-only mirrors:
  ```bash
  for f in ds-tokens.md ds-components.md figma-gotchas.md; do
    cp ../{{DS_REPO}}/skills/$f skills/$f   # then re-add the mirror header block
  done
  ```
  (The source of truth for those three is `{{DS_REPO}}`; do not edit them here.)
- **New shared principle** → it goes in `{{DS_REPO}}/DESIGN.md`; mirror the copy here.
- `git commit && git push`. Next session picks it up.

## Relationship to {{DS_REPO}}

`{{DS_REPO}}` publishes {{SYSTEM_NAME}} + owns tokens/components/manifest; **this** repo consumes the
published library to build screens + prototypes. {{SYSTEM_NAME}} gaps found while building route back there as
tokenization/component requests. `DESIGN.md` is shared ground truth both read. See `AGENTS-HANDOFF.md`.

